php-kint-php-kint for Debian
============================

This package provides the kint-php/kint library for use with the Debian
PHP autoloader system.

Autoloader: `/usr/share/php/Kint/autoload.php`

Usage in PHP:

    require_once '/usr/share/php/Kint/autoload.php';

 -- Vítězslav Dvořák <info@vitexsoftware.cz>
